SY_TALK("iPrgfaTPPPY",[[0,["subtitled (Het team van vertaling en ondertiteling)  --&gt;Versie: 2022 1101"]],[0,["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iPrgfaTPPPY"]],[0,[": https://www.amruta.org/p/5769"]],[0,["Archive audio: H.H. Shri Mataji Nirmala Devi at Sahaja Yoga Public Program 1979 0611 in Caxton Hall, London (England)."]],[0,["1979-0611 How Aspects Of God Are Expressed London Source NITL"]],[1,["…Thank you. Come along. See those who are… You come in front, all right?"]],[7,["Better thing is that the new people sit in front. It’s better. Yes. Hello. Good. Very good."]],[24,["So I would like to give you a little idea about this picture that we have in front of us (chakra chart)."]],[33,["Now whom we call as God Almighty, the One who is eternal, who doesn’t incarnate,"]],[43,["who is all the time there watching the play of His Power, the Primordial Mother,"]],[52,["is manifested through to Her Power into His three aspects here, clearly, within ourselves"]],[61,["and within the Primordial Being who is the ultimate which all the created people have to reach."]],[73,["Now there’s a difference between the two, the Almighty, God, as you call Him,"]],[82,["the One who never incarnates, and the One who incarnates on this Earth"]],[91,["and occupies a position like this, just like a human being,"]],[97,["and He’s called as a Primordial Being or you can say the Viraata,"]],[104,["you can call Him the Viraat. Actually, though He’s called as ‘Primordial Being’,"]],[109,["He’s an aspect of God. So these are two things if you understand,"]],[114,["I will be able to explain to you how the aspects of God are expressed in us."]],[123,["So the first aspect of God is His desire to create,"]],[130,["His desire to create and in His desire to create …"]],[135,["(Oh, you were outside there Linda, I didn’t recognise. Come along, I’m sorry"]],[138,["I didn’t recognise you, I never recognised you, I’m sorry, I never recognised. I thought,"]],[144,["“Who is this one?” I’m sorry. So, this side would be better.)"]],[152,["So His desire to manifest, His desire to create,"]],[160,["that’s the aspect within us which is represented by this blue colour line"]],[166,["which is called as the Adi Ida Nadi, or you can call it the primordial Ida channel by which He desires."]],[176,["Now as a desire can be born and can be finished off, can be switched off, in the same way,"]],[186,["His desire to create also can be over. His desire to create any more may be over."]],[195,["His desire not to create for the time being could be there."]],[200,["So if you understand your desires, you can understand His desire also to create"]],[205,["and that’s why when He does not desire to have it anymore, the creation He can destroy."]],[213,["So He is the One through which we exist and through which we are destroyed, too."]],[220,["So He’s the One who manifests existence and destruction of Creation."]],[226,["That’s why He is called as Destroyer."]],[230,["This aspect is represented by the principle of Shiva;"]],[235,["which never incarnates because this principle is the one which is the germ,"]],[241,["which is the beginning and which is the end of everything."]],[244,["Like a seed becomes the seed ultimately, in the same way this Shiva Tattwa,"]],[251,["this principle of Shiva, germinates, creates and then it again becomes the same principle."]],[259,["That’s why the principle of Shiva never changes. It is called as Shiva,"]],[264,["means it is permanent, it is eternal. The rest of Them go into manifestations."]],[273,["So first He desired and He wanted to create. So He had to have His aspect of Creator being put in"]],[281,["and the second aspect of Creator (aside: can you show [them]?) is the,"]],[286,["this yellow line that shows here is the Pingala Nadi, called as Adi Pingala,"]],[291,["the Primordial Pingala channel by which He has created this Universe."]],[297,["Now the centre of this figure you can find this green round circle"]],[307,["and this one is the one, is the space in which He created."]],[315,["He created in this space and that’s why this space is called as Bhavasagara."]],[321,["Is the Ocean of Creation. ‘Bhava’ is the one that is created."]],[330,["Bhu, Bhava means the one… exactly it is the one that is done;"]],[336,["bhava is done, means created. So the Creator then produces all the stars and the,"]],[348,["all the galaxies, solar plexus, lunar plexuses, all the so-called mandalas. He does all that work."]],[361,["But as you would say that first of all this blue line, if you follow it up,"]],[367,["goes absolutely to the first centre, here. Now this line represents,"]],[374,["though it manifests the Shiva principle, it is manifested or, you can say, it’s carried on,"]],[384,["through the power of Shiva that is known as Mahakali."]],[389,["That’s the power of Mahakali which descends up to the lowest point there"]],[394,["which is the first centre that is created by Mahakali Herself, and this centre is"]],[402,["called as the Mooladhara Chakra. On this She has created first of all the first deity,"]],[408,["the first we can call the Aradhya Devata. The one deity"]],[414,["which is to be worshipped first in this whole world is the deity that is the embodiment of innocence."]],[421,["So innocence was the first thing that was created by God, and not cunningness."]],[429,["Cunningness is our by-product, you see. He created innocence and holiness"]],[437,["and that’s how he put the deity there and that deity is called as Shri Ganesha."]],[444,["It’s a, later on you will know that the same embodiment of innocence"]],[450,["incarnated on this earth as Jesus Christ. Now this is a very, very important chakra"]],[460,["or the centre about which I will tell you later on."]],[464,["But then after creating this, you see, God is a very, I should say, a very, very compassionate"]],[473,["and affectionate being. He is the source of all our compassion and affection"]],[481,["because He resides in the heart as Shiva there – you can see His place there."]],[486,["And then He wanted to produce somebody who would – after creating this."]],[490,["First He created the chakra for the innocence. That was the most primarily important thing,"]],[497,["was to create innocence on this earth, to protect people. Innocence is auspiciousness,"]],[502,["is called as mangalakari. Is the one that gives you auspiciousness."]],[508,["Now about auspiciousness also they have had a tape with them, you can ask them what it gives."]],[515,["And it is a thing that was first created, means"]],[519,["that for us the blessings were created even before He started creating these galaxies."]],[526,["So He created a place in the space from where He could emit His blessings on this earth."]],[535,["So secondly, then, He, before even creating the Creator, He just thought,"]],[540,["“Let Me put Him up. Let Me have another aspect manifested,” which is the central,"]],[546,["centre path, in the – from the centre path which is known as the Sushumna,"]],[554,["is the centre path of sustenance, of your dharma."]],[559,["Before creating anything else He created this one because this is the centre of seeking,"]],[569,["is the centre of seeking."]],[572,["And this seeking was created even from the smallest of animals you know."]],[578,["When amoeba was created he’s had a seeking. Otherwise he would never have evolved."]],[584,["And the, of course, the seeking changed its mode and its tone but"]],[588,["there was a seeking first implanted at that point and for that He had to create a deity"]],[595,["of His aspect of sustenance which was called as Shri Vishnu."]],[601,["His power is Mahalakshmi which is that channel, is the centre power."]],[607,["Now the third one that He created out of it actually [UNCLEAR]."]],[613,["These are from here, what He made first of all from here is very formal"]],[619,["and [INAUDIBLE for about 15 sec]"]],[643,["and this power is called as the power of Mahasaraswati."]],[649,["So you have got three powers of Mahakali, Mahasaraswati and Mahalakshmi."]],[662,["This universe then was created through galaxies and through many … solar systems"]],[671,["and if you happen to read one of the so-called article of Mine on solar plexus"]],[680,["or on the creation itself you will know how we were created very carefully,"]],[686,["how the earth was created, how it was taken away. Part of it was taken away from the sun,"]],[693,["taken very far away first and then adjusted, brought to a point where life could grow."]],[699,["All that was done and so the earth was created."]],[704,["Now the first chakra, as I told you, is the Ganesha’s chakra."]],[712,["Now this chakra is most important for us because this is the centre of Shri Ganesha"]],[723,["who is the son of Mahakali’s residual power which we can call as the Gauri."]],[733,["It is that, you can see in the centre, it’s also called as the Kundalini."]],[739,["After creating the whole thing, I mean desiring the whole thing,"]],[745,["He put part of that – that’s why we call it residual power – into that Kundalini,"]],[757,["the Adi Kundalini which would record all that is happening within"]],[767,["and later on when the time comes it would give you your second birth."]],[772,["So this is the Kundalini here. It is placed in three and a half coil"]],[777,["because three and a half coil brings forth eternal movement like your watches which are,"]],[784,["say, automatic are… also have got three and a half coils just to put it in automatic way."]],[791,["That’s how this idea must have come to somebody that we should put three and a half coils"]],[794,["to have automatic watches, you see. So this is the three and a half coils there placed."]],[799,["And that’s the Mother."]],[804,["That’s the Mother. That’s the Virgin. That’s the One sitting down there."]],[810,["Now this is the Mother who had not yet met Her husband but was married, but still a virgin."]],[817,["And the story is very interesting how She created Ganesha."]],[822,["She was worried that somebody may come inside the bathroom so She,"]],[829,["out of Her body these things, what you call mala, the dirt on Her body,"]],[838,["She took out some soil or clay that we use in India for washing the hands."]],[844,["Our clay is very good. And She put all the clay and took it out and made out of that a Ganesha."]],[851,["And put Him down there, at that point because She wanted somebody to protect Her."]],[858,["(Somebody has come? If you lock the door, how will I know? It’s all right)"]],[868,["So this protection was created there for Her."]],[875,["But actually that’s the One is also protecting Her protocol."]],[880,["That means this chakra nobody can enter into. Nobody can touch it."]],[888,["Through this centre anybody who tries to come in will be punished."]],[893,["Now, those people who say that Kundalini can be risen through sex are, I must say,"]],[899,["either sadly mistaken or are sinister people,"]],[903,["because that’s the centre is to protect Her protocol."]],[907,["He never would allow anybody to enter through that point because that is the point"]],[913,["which regulates and controls the sex."]],[918,["So that is a very, very holy place through which you cannot enter."]],[925,["The reason is, say, if there is mud and if there is all kind of filth,"]],[932,["best thing is to put there the most purest form of deity who’d never gets embellished"]],[938,["or who does not get hurt or in any way involved into that filth."]],[944,["So He, being the purest, He was placed there."]],[948,["Like Christ came on this earth to a place, like horrible place like Bethlehem and all this,"]],[953,["just because there was no other way out, you see. He was the only one who could come there"]],[959,["and sustain these people who wanted to crucify Him later on."]],[963,["So He came down later but this embodiment of innocence was put there."]],[970,["Innocence is a thing which never is cunning and intelligent as you think intelligence"]],[977,["is supposed to be. It’s very different type of intelligence it has got that it just works out."]],[984,["You may be any amount of intelligence you may have and you may try to trick the innocence by"]],[990,["any chances or by any, any sort of fraudulent ways. You cannot cheat."]],[996,["Innocence is above all that."]],[999,["And that is what was very important and that’s why He was placed there."]],[1005,["Now the people who have been practicing this kind of a nonsensical stuff like"]],[1013,["going to Kundalini through the sex are really doing a very abusive and horrible thing"]],[1020,["to their own Mother, who is the Kundalini. Kundalini is your Mother."]],[1025,["She has been with you for ages and She has been waiting for this day"]],[1030,["when you could get your Realisation."]],[1033,["So those who try such tricks on the Kundalini, on their Mother,"]],[1038,["you can imagine how much they should be punished."]],[1041,["That’s why so many people get all these horrible experiences, of getting blisters in the body,"]],[1046,["they get heat in the body, sometimes they get a temperature and they get stuck up"]],[1052,["and all sort of things happen because of this kind of unauthorised behaviour."]],[1059,["The another thing could be to freeze this Ganesha, is to become a person"]],[1066,["who is absolutely running away from sex. One does not have to run away from sex"]],[1075,["because sex is one of the activities of Ganesha because He’s a child,"]],[1081,["He doesn’t understand what is sex is. He’s abodh. He’s innocent."]],[1085,["He doesn’t know that sex is something. You see, He has no consciousness of it."]],[1093,["Like a child when He sees sex, for Him it is just like seeing flowers so nothing… he,"]],[1100,["he doesn’t understand it. After a certain age only people start understanding it."]],[1105,["So those people who also run away from sex are equally the same because"]],[1110,["there’s nothing to run away and there’s nothing to run to."]],[1113,["It has to be understood at this point that sex has to be a very sacred"]],[1120,["and a secret thing between two personalities that is husband and wife"]],[1125,["who should be really married, collectively."]],[1128,["A marriage which is done secretly somewhere and marriage secretly done somewhere"]],[1132,["is always brings problems. So marriage must be done in a open way"]],[1138,["and should be sanctioned collectively."]],[1140,["Marriage is not an institution came to human beings from somewhere outside,"]],[1147,["but it has come to them from within."]],[1150,["God Himself has brought this institution within them and it is to be respected in full way."]],[1155,["And family life is the basis, absolutely the basis of human beings."]],[1161,["Every human being must have a nest to grow when they are children."]],[1167,["We are playing havoc with this principle of family life everywhere"]],[1172,["and we are really out to ruin our children through abandoning the norms"]],[1178,["that are required for a human life. I mean, we have taken up everything into our hands, you see,"]],[1183,["as if we can do whatever we feel."]],[1186,["Perhaps by that we do not realise how we are giving no fair chance to our children to grow"]],[1193,["in a proper, secure place. So family life is a very important thing"]],[1199,["and must be dealt with in a way, the way you do a Puja, you do a worship."]],[1208,["The home is a temple where you must have all the holy things, to give children the holiness,"]],[1217,["the innocence that is required for them to continue."]],[1221,["Here if you find now the children are so precocious,"]],[1225,["sometimes you are shocked the way they are precocious because"]],[1227,["the parents talk all these things in their presence and they say, “What’s wrong?”"]],[1232,["Like you are teaching children about sex. What is there to teach? I really can’t understand."]],[1237,["What is there to teach? Every dog, every, I mean all these birds, everybody,"]],[1243,["they know what sex is. Oh, no, human beings need a teaching out of it."]],[1247,["I mean, Indians who are supposed to be most uneducated people,"]],[1251,["they are doing much better than all of you are doing here."]],[1257,["It beats me to understand how you people start thinking about teaching everything, even sex."]],[1264,["You see, it is of course to be guided properly through family channels"]],[1268,["but not to be talked so openly, you know. In the beginning it was very difficult for Me even"]],[1272,["to open My mouth. But when I saw the whole thing is so filled with it,"]],[1275,["let Me talk about it. Because it is not to be talked, it is not to be mentioned,"]],[1280,["it’s a very sacred thing between husband and wife and to be kept as sacred."]],[1284,["But if you excite it too much, from the childhood if you give ideas and all that,"]],[1288,["you see unnaturally people are brought up in that way into a very unnatural atmosphere"]],[1294,["and you become nothing but a sex point."]],[1296,["The amount of, you see, importance is given to sex life, you see,"]],[1301,["as if, as if they are impotent."]],[1306,["I mean, it is something like that. It amounts to that, the way people are, it’s such a natural thing."]],[1312,["It’s such a spontaneous thing. It’s available to everyone."]],[1315,["What is there for people to think so much about it and plan about it,"]],[1322,["talk about it and make the whole thing so vulgar?"]],[1326,["There are certain rules and regulations that are to be followed. I mean,"]],[1329,["you have to be very, very chaste about it and there’s a certain protocol"]],[1334,["and certain beauty of making it a secret. The more I find now here people,"]],[1341,["I’m just talking about the West because we are concerned with Western problems."]],[1345,["Indians have another type which I will tell you later."]],[1348,["They have another horrible types of problems but this is another type we have."]],[1352,["Like a, like we find two people going up the escalator, they must kiss, you see."]],[1358,["They shouldn’t miss one point even. Every step they must go on kissing."]],[1361,["All right. And where are you going? To the divorce court, that’s what it is. You know, it’s so absurd."]],[1368,["There is no deep understanding of the marriage institution."]],[1372,["We cannot exist without marriage institution."]],[1375,["Marriage institution is a gift of God to human beings and not to animals."]],[1380,["We are not going to become again animals. They study the sexual behavior of, say, of fishes."]],[1389,["I mean, are you going to become fishes now? Are we to learn from pigs?"]],[1394,["I mean, have we gone that low that we have to go down up to fishes’ level"]],[1399,["and find out how to behave? I mean, it’s absurd."]],[1406,["So this is this centre which is very important and it’s very sacred,"]],[1411,["but the other side I told you that is to running away from sex."]],[1415,["On this point I would like to speak because perhaps I have not spoken so much as that."]],[1420,["This is another craze that people have, is to suppress the sex, is to have nunneries,"]],[1426,["to have places like where the fathers are living in a very unnatural manner,"]],[1434,["create situations where there is no husband-wife relation existing."]],[1438,["I would say Navy has this problem, too. And thank God now Navy has decided to have women"]],[1445,["on board and the wives on board, you see. And actually it has working wonders"]],[1451,["because they are very good husbands, people have found out,"]],[1454,["and it gives them some chance to exist normally. I mean, imagine that every port you get,"]],[1462,["you get some new girl and end to a complication, fighting with another."]],[1466,["All sorts of problems come up. This multi, multi-women business is going to make you mad."]],[1476,["I mean, to live with one woman itself it’s sufficient."]],[1478,["But to have many women is much more dangerous. So the another thing starts."]],[1483,["See, human beings are like that. If they cannot they’ll go one side, complete indulgences."]],[1487,["They’ll have ten women, get hit, beaten up, finished by that, absolutely broken up,"]],[1495,["becoming insolvent. Ultimately they are left like that. Then they become sadhus."]],[1500,["To the other end they will go. They become the sadhus and the sadhus start, you see, then,"]],[1508,["“Give up sex. Have nothing to do. Don’t see a woman."]],[1512,["Just you can’t bear her.” You see, this is madness."]],[1515,["Why go from one extreme to another extreme?"]],[1518,["Why not see it in a poised and a proper manner that marriage is important,"]],[1525,["husband-wife is an important thing. But that’s not the end of life there also."]],[1529,["But still running away from it is something one cannot explain."]],[1536,["Otherwise why God has made you women and men? One should understand about it."]],[1541,["And secondly, those who run away like that, I mean if the women run away, God save this world,"]],[1546,["but if men run away what do they get? You see, they run away from it to another, another style."]],[1552,["And what happens with that? You just have a look here."]],[1555,["This is the chakra of the Devi which [UNCLEAR] to run away from."]],[1562,["Now there is no way. You cannot go to this one because it is a… this is the one which is [UNCLEAR]."]],[1575,["Thus your attention is just from there you go. There is no attention at all."]],[1582,["No attention there [UNCLEAR]. [UNCLEAR] convert your fat into a proper fat"]],[1598,["which can be consumed by brain. So as soon as you do that you start thinking about sex."]],[1603,["That is what it is. People are not spontaneous but they are thinking."]],[1610,["They’ll plan out about it. Everything is planned out and then what happens you start thinking about it"]],[1615,["but you don’t have any sex. So the people who say, “We are nuns, we are nuns,”"]],[1621,["they are thinking about it all the time. But they do not have the actual thing which should be done."]],[1626,["It would be something like eating food with your nose, try to push your food through your nose."]],[1633,["You see that there is no thinking needed for this and you start thinking about it."]],[1791,["So they start thinking. How can they get rid of it? You just tell Me."]],[1641,["There’s no sublimation, so-called sublimation and all that nonsense."]],[1645,["If there is no chance of sublimation only the attention will move."]],[1648,["How will you sublimate this part when there is a barrier here"]],[1652,["and this one is as the special one sitting there, with a big rod in his hand?"]],[1656,["We call it as the parasha. How do you cross that point? You cannot just cross it."]],[1661,["So what you do? You remove your attention from there and predict."]],[1665,["Now this is the one which we call as the, also called as the sun line."]],[1670,["It’s the sun line, called as sun line. So you move towards the sun."]],[1676,["That’s why you people are such worshippers of sun."]],[1681,["Now, then burn your body. You see, you will not have sex but burn your body"]],[1688,["and make yourself look what you call that brown colour"]],[1691,["and do all kind of nonsensical things to your body. Be unkind to it."]],[1696,["Try to do your level best to ruin it. That’s what you do. And then this sun line starts acting."]],[1703,["Now, sun line takes you away from the left side."]],[1707,["You see that if too much activity starts here it’s"]],[1711,["because your whole attention goes on this side and it is…[UNCLEAR]."]],[1716,["That’s why you become extremely dry. I mean, such a person, I would say Hitler,"]],[1723,["Hitler was nothing but this. Hitler had no feelings left in him at all."]],[1729,["There was no emotional thing left in him. He was drained out."]],[1733,["And all these yogis also of this type have this. Like we had a guru in our, you see,"]],[1741,["in Durvasa. I mean, if he’d looked at somebody he would burn off. Just imagine."]],[1745,["Such horrible ones, what are they going to do for the emancipation of human beings?"]],[1752,["What are they going to do for the Kalyana, for the betterment of human beings"]],[1758,["who haven’t got a grain of love within them? All your idea of love is drained out."]],[1766,["Then you must have heard about these gurus, that the way they are."]],[1769,["Most of them I’ve seen, even the realised ones, needs lot of love within them."]],[1773,["I’ve seen so many realised ones also but they believe in beating the people."]],[1778,["You know, anybody comes to them, first of all they’ll put a big chimta on them, hit them, cut."]],[1783,["“Oh, you are not good.” They, they test your head by hitting."]],[1788,["And you know, sometimes tears would roll down My eyes seeing all that cruelty."]],[1794,["I said, “How can you do this to them?”"]],[1797,["They said, “You don’t know these human beings. They deserve it."]],[1800,["We were like that. Now we are better.” I said, “What are you better? You are hitting the same way.”"]],[1805,["But they are realised people. Can you imagine?"]],[1808,["Even without knowing much about love they get Realisation and then they start saying,"]],[1813,["“Now, go into absolute vairanth.” Take the case of our Buddha."]],[1819,["Now Buddha was one of the very great incarnations in the sense that He was the son,"]],[1825,["one of the sons of Rama who incarnated on this earth,"]],[1830,["Buddha, to occupy the highest life on this earth."]],[1834,["So He had to take sanyasa because without that He could not show that."]],[1838,["But there was no need for anybody else to take sanyasa. But in His case mistakes,"]],[1847,["I mean, why there were some mistakes about things,"]],[1850,["because when He tried all these tricks of sanyasa, going here"]],[1856,["and there He never realised that this is all not needed."]],[1862,["He was so tired and fagged out, that suddenly, spontaneous,"]],[1867,["the Primordial Mother Herself gave Him the realisation because He was so tired."]],[1874,["Now supposing this is Caxton Hall. To come here you go to, say, Reading,"]],[1881,["then you go to in the north to Leeds, then you go this side and then you go to Brighton"]],[1888,["and come back here. And you tell everybody,"]],[1891,["“If you have to go to Caxton Hall you better do all that.”"]],[1895,["It is just like that. It is just like that, very misleading."]],[1899,["Because when He found it out, as you have found out too,"]],[1903,["you do not realise how you have found it. You do not know how you have done it."]],[1912,["If I do not tell you that it is God who has done it, how are you going to believe it?"]],[1916,["You will think, “I’ve done Self-realisation, all right. I am a self-realised person.”"]],[1920,["Self is most important. That’s why He believed this Anishvarvad means atheism. He said,"]],[1927,["“There is no God. Only thing, the Self is to be achieved.” Naturally,"]],[1930,["because there was nobody to tell Him that you have achieved"]],[1933,["through the grace of the Primordial Mother."]],[1935,["So He was to be born again as one of the sons of Fatimabai"]],[1942,["who was the daughter of Mohammed Sahib."]],[1946,["Then again He was to be born as Markandeya and again as Shankaracharya,"]],[1954,["just to neutralise what He has been preaching."]],[1957,["So you will see that in the sixth century Shankaracharya is the one who put end to Buddhism,"]],[1962,["the nonsense of Buddhism in India."]],[1965,["Because apart from what Buddha’s understanding of the whole thing is His disciples"]],[1971,["made it so perverse that somebody had to come down to tell"]],[1975,["that marriage system has to be re-established."]],[1982,["And this is how this right side was controlled through various incarnations coming down."]],[1989,["But now we come to the centre point, is the Vishnu Tattwa, as I told you,"]],[1994,["the principle of sustenance within us. By this sustenance force only we have within us our dharma,"]],[2003,["means we are human beings. Human beings have to have some sustenance."]],[2008,["Otherwise he would have two horns. He would have a tail hanging around."]],[2012,["But he does not. He doesn’t have. Why human beings do not have horns?"]],[2017,["Why do not they have tails? I mean, they behave sometimes like that but still they don’t develop."]],[2023,["You see, in churches in children it is very common to tell them that"]],[2027,["“If you behave like this you will start developing a tail.” Immediately they’ll start looking."]],[2032,["“Have we already developed?” Then you have to tell them, “Not yet.”"]],[2036,["“But then be careful about us, you see. Better tell us. Otherwise we’ll develop it.”"]],[2040,["So this is how we are, that we are human beings."]],[2043,["If we were not human beings our noses would have been like that or could have been like that."]],[2049,["But we are human beings. That’s why we have a particular type of a face."]],[2052,["We have a particular type of eyes. You have seen in the animal kingdom how the eyes are placed."]],[2058,["Like fishes, how their eyes are placed according to their environment,"]],[2062,["according to their evolution. Now why should we try to be fishes? Have you got eyes like fishes?"]],[2068,["We are human beings. We have to be human beings."]],[2071,["And the human beings have got as in the four varanas are described,"]],[2076,["they have to move in a evolutionary process with their understanding."]],[2083,["This is the biggest difference between a human being and animal."]],[2087,["So far from animal to this stage you do not know how you came up."]],[2091,["You never felt your evolution. You never knew that what, how you evolved into it."]],[2097,["But only when you have become a human being you can feel it."]],[2103,["That’s why your evolution had to be in such a manner that you can feel it."]],[2110,["And you have also got a special faculty of deciding for yourself,"]],[2118,["of freedom by which you develop yourself in such a manner that you can feel it."]],[2124,["The fishes never felt it. The amoeba never felt it."]],[2127,["It’s only you who can feel your evolution because you are at the topmost position of evolution"]],[2135,["and if it has to move forward it has to be in your own awareness with all respect to your freedom."]],[2144,["So freedom was given to human being, not only that"]],[2148,["but also that they are going to see their own evolution within themselves."]],[2155,["They are going to feel it. You’ll feel so different as soon as you are evolved,"]],[2161,["because you are the highest. Human beings, if they had ever evaluated themselves,"]],[2167,["even if they had asked this question to themselves,"]],[2170,["“Why did I became human being from that insignificant amoeba?” then they would have realised,"]],[2178,["evaluated their value. But when they evaluate themselves,"]],[2182,["when they try to understand themselves they become egoistical. This is the problem."]],[2188,["And that also comes from the same sun line. You see the ego – that’s the yellow,"]],[2195,["that balloon of ego – when it covers the whole being a person just, you see,"]],[2200,["he talks as if he is possessed. He can never understand what he is talking about"]],[2208,["and what he is meaning when he says, “I, I, I, I, I,” because you are not a separate entity."]],[2219,["You are a part and parcel of the whole. And when you start saying,"]],[2224,["“I, I,” you actually secede yourself. You cut yourself short of your connections with the whole."]],[2237,["With this understanding if you see, here the centre chakra which is the,"]],[2243,["what we call the Nabhi chakra."]],[2245,["Here the sustenance was established and through its establishment,"]],[2250,["the seat for your evolution was created. So we evolve through our sustenance,"]],[2257,["through our evolutionary process by which we have a complete incarnation of this principle"]],[2269,["of Vishnu, is Krishna who is placed there. So from this Vishnu Tattwa"]],[2276,["when you go around the Bhavasagara till that point you are still trying to come out of it"]],[2284,["and at this point you come out and here is [UNCLEAR] Shri Rama."]],[2294,["Normally this place is occupied by the deity of Mahakali? or you can call..[UNCLEAR]."]],[2304,["Which comes from here, this power, normally, and then She incarnates in this Bhavasagara"]],[2312,["where the seekers are trying to find God."]],[2316,["Because every time the seekers tried to find God there were evil forces"]],[2322,["which tried to put it down. So She had to incarnate."]],[2326,["They say She incarnated only one thousand times"]],[2329,["but I think She has incarnated many more times. But whatever it is,"]],[2333,["She incarnated one thousand times and She protected these, Her bhaktas or Her,"]],[2341,["what you call, Her devotees to be saved from the satanic forces."]],[2348,["Now this one is the incarnation of Vaikadesha but before that all those incarnations"]],[2358,["that came are up to this point. Now this one, one must understand is,"]],[2365,["these devya were actually normal human beings. They could not come up."]],[2371,["Because Rama was not regarded as an incarnation."]],[2376,["He was seen as absolutely a human being who was still on this sun line,"]],[2382,["the rajasa, the absolutely human being. This is the rajasa."]],[2388,["That is the tamasa, on the left hand side. This is the rajasa."]],[2392,["And the centre one is the satwa. That’s why He was placed there."]],[2396,["Now this Goddess is the power which exists in your heart chakra in the centre."]],[2404,["Now when the child is small, you must know that all the antibodies develop in the sternum,"]],[2410,["in the sternum. And these antibodies are actually the fighters"]],[2416,["who fight evil or any harm to the body."]],[2421,["These bodies, what you call these antibodies, spread to the whole being"]],[2430,["and after, say, twelve years or so they start acting automatically or, you can say,"]],[2436,["even spontaneously. Sometimes they are on their own, because they are trained in this area,"]],[2443,["in the sternum area, how to fight the disease, how to fight the outward invasions."]],[2450,["Even the mental trouble which comes to you comes through some sort of a satanic force"]],[2455,["which can be in a very, in the form of a small lacuna and then they attack there."]],[2462,["And that’s how they work out. So this is the,"]],[2464,["in the sternum here is placed the power of the Durga or you can call the Mother,"]],[2473,["the Mother of this earth, Jagadamba. She’s the One who is the Mother of this earth."]],[2480,["And She, Her power comes from the back here,"]],[2483,["where you have a centre called as the Hridaya (Heart) chakra"]],[2489,["but we can say that it looks after the cardiac plexus in the human being."]],[2494,["So those people who have got say asthma are suffering from the same."]],[2500,["Those women who have got, say, breast cancer have suffering from the same,"]],[2506,["means the sense of insecurity. If you have sense of insecurity then these,"]],[2511,["these lungs start breathing fast. You have seen suddenly you,"]],[2516,["if you meet with fear you get that breathing very fast in you."]],[2519,["And this breathing is denoting or is pointing out to some sort of a fear that is working within you."]],[2529,["It could be due to previous conditionings or could be immediate, but this centre starts working,"]],[2539,["breathing starts moving at a very high speed and that is the sign of this centre"]],[2546,["that it starts emitting power of protection when if you start breathing heavily."]],[2552,["But it is automatically done."]],[2554,["And the women who suffer from sense of insecurity get breast cancer"]],[2559,["and that also this is the centre. While I will be talking to you about various diseases"]],[2565,["how we can cure through Sahaja Yoga then I’ll tell you more about it."]],[2569,["Now the highest point of the sustenance is here, just here."]],[2576,["When man raised his head upward, this is the point where Shri Krishna, the,"]],[2583,["the highest goal of human evolution reached its completion poornatha. At that time we,"]],[2594,["we should say that when we raised our heads up He established Himself in our Vishuddhi chakra."]],[2601,["And He is the one who is this Primordial Being."]],[2607,["He is the One who grows into that Primordial Being."]],[2611,["About Shri Krishna also I will tell you, I think, later on because you can understand"]],[2618,["He has sixteen petals. He has the largest number of petals"]],[2623,["which in physical way look after your ear, nose, throat, these mastoid muscles and teeth"]],[2632,["and all, all this portion. Apart from that if you notice it that this ego and superego,"]],[2640,["you see, actually they do not rise that high up."]],[2643,["They rise from here it starts, from this centre only give the complete start."]],[2650,["Complete start from this centre… [INAUDIBLE]"]],[2653,["but they cross at this centre which we call as the Agnya chakra."]],[2662,["Now pumping of the ego and superego comes like the, we can say, the fumes from a factory."]],[2676,["Like when you are overactive on the right hand side you develop your ego as a by-product."]],[2683,["If somebody says, “I have no ego,” well, it’s wrong, not possible."]],[2688,["There is all the time ego within you."]],[2691,["Like people said, “Krishna has said that ‘Oh, you, you just surrender everything to Me,’"]],[2697,["and that’s how I have surrendered myself to Him.” It’s wrong."]],[2703,["You cannot do it, because you have got ego. You have to cross beyond."]],[2708,["Unless and until you cross behind – beyond, you cannot get over your ego."]],[2713,["So these ego and superego, if you see, they cross. So the superego is, say, from here to here."]],[2720,["The ego is from here to here."]],[2722,["But as the human beings started growing the superego which is the conditioning in us,"]],[2727,["the conditioning as seen by the psychologists, they call it the psyche part"]],[2732,["and they never realised that there is also ego."]],[2735,["If you remove the conditionings completely from human beings, do whatever you please,"]],[2739,["you become egoistical. They never realised this subtle point"]],[2744,["and they allowed you to do whatever you liked, and they allowed you to, sort of fully assert yourself."]],[2753,["Then they did never realise that on the other side is also this ego developing within you."]],[2759,["And that’s why we have got now countries we can say which are ego-oriented."]],[2764,["Others are superego-oriented."]],[2767,["But now the stage is such that nothing much to choose, it’s such a confusion and a muddle."]],[2779,["they tried to push the superego down like that which went to such a limit that it started hurting people."]],[2786,["They couldn’t bear it so they came up with their superego."]],[2790,["And this is the beginning of people talking about, “I feel very guilty,” “I’m very sorry,”"]],[2797,["“We must have some sympathy for others,”"]],[2800,["“We must look after the people who are suffering,” and all that kind of a thing."]],[2805,["Then they take to also drugs. Also you can see that all this left side is more sort of meant for people"]],[2814,["who take drugs and who go into lethargy and more sitting down and dreaming for poets, all sorts of things."]],[2821,["[Missing part]"]],[2822,["went to India and invaded India and now I am responsible for that."]],[2827,["You start feeling guilty for somebody who’s died and is born somewhere in Africa or maybe born in Timbuktu."]],[2838,["You see maybe that you are the one who was a saint in India"]],[2841,["and who has been looked after the Mother and today you are here crying for nothing at all."]],[2848,["So this is the situation of today’s muddled-up world and the superego,"]],[2854,["or the others who were supposed to be superego, non-aggressive people,"]],[2858,["say like Indian people, now are, they are developing, they are getting sophisticated, you see."]],[2864,["And they think that to wear a suit is a very big thing."]],[2867,["If you wear a suit they start speaking some other language."]],[2870,["And to them you see to be posh, to be very impressive and all that is very important."]],[2878,["Whether they have food or not doesn’t matter but must dress up well to impress people,"]],[2883,["you see, and that’s why I tell always my disciples that when you go to India don’t go like hippies."]],[2888,["Better go like very well-dressed government servants. And you can only impress them only…."]],[2894,["And there, so we are developing now in India and we are becoming very materialistic, extremely materialistic."]],[2902,["I mean not that you people here in the West have left your materialism to that extent"]],[2907,["but I mean here every Dick, Tom and Harry is not a materialistic person."]],[2911,["Specially the people who are of a higher style, they are not that materialistic."]],[2916,["But like, your, you see, the labor class here you can say as they are very particular now…"]],[2921,["Today was the budget day, last day"]],[2925,["so all the shops were on and everybody was buying even the jewellery?, then everything,"]],[2929,["in the shops, you see. But the Indians would be the most, you see,"]],[2933,["because they must see what is happening here. As soon as… I wouldn’t say Indians,"]],[2938,["all the Asians I would put like that, not only Indians,"]],[2942,["because you see when they come to England they see in the shops, you see."]],[2947,["They make the list of saris they have to take home."]],[2949,["They make the list of things they have to take home."]],[2952,["They are equally the same as you have been long time back."]],[2956,["Like you’ll be amazed that once upon a time plastic was a big, big craze for you people here"]],[2962,["and nylon was also once upon a time. Now we are trying to wear nylons for you."]],[2968,["It’s a good exchange, I think, but this is what we are in the muddle, either in the superego or ego."]],[2974,["We cannot just fix the person. He could be one moment in the superego, one moment in the ego."]],[2979,["He’ll be just going from one side to another."]],[2982,["The thing that really gives you the balance is the sustenance, is the sustenance, dharma."]],[2990,["If you do not have that then you could go, shoot off like a pendulum from this side to that."]],[3004,["So I mean if you try to make the dharma a fanatic idea like none of these incarnations,"]],[3011,["like Mohamed Sahib who was an incarnation of the Primordial Master"]],[3016,["and all others like Him – Moses, Abraham – anyone of Them who came on this earth,"]],[3021,["ever thought of fanaticism. Never they realised that when they told,"]],[3027,["“Don’t do this. Don’t do that,” some sort of people will take up upon themselves that,"]],[3032,["“We are the chosen ones. We are the great.” I mean, this they could have never understood"]],[3039,["and whenever they found it was happening again they took birth."]],[3042,["Again they took birth to tell people this is not dharma."]],[3046,["To form any kind of a cult or an organisation and religion is against God. It’s blasphemous."]],[3054,["How can you organise God? You cannot."]],[3057,["Those who have done it always have brought absolute fall of human beings. You see,"]],[3063,["that’s why you cannot control. Like the other day I was saying"]],[3065,["that our Pope has good intentions of going to Poland."]],[3069,["But in a way I like Polish Catholicism more than the Irish one."]],[3074,["If this is the freedom what Catholicism is, better not have it."]],[3080,["You see, if this is what you are going to achieve through your Catholicism, better not have it."]],[3084,["In Poland, say, for example, people do not do philanthropic work, you see,"]],[3089,["like helping the poor. Is that the work of Christ? I asked somebody, I said,"]],[3094,["“How did you come to this conclusion that Christ wanted you to help the poor?”"]],[3099,["They said, “Because You know once He was to be,"]],[3102,["He was to be anointed with some very expensive oil,” and I think Judah said that"]],[3110,["‘How can you spend such a lot of money on Him, on His body?"]],[3116,["Let us sell it and give it to the poor.'”"]],[3118,["So He said – now, see, listen to this one carefully – He said that, “Poor are forever,”"]],[3125,["means it’s a permanent headache, you see, “but I am for a short time.”"]],[3129,["That means spiritual life is the thing. Now, in the same way He said that"]],[3134,["“No rich man can enter into the kingdom of God.”"]],[3138,["Both are just the same. Poor are just the same as the rich. Do you find any difference in them?"]],[3142,["I do not. One hankers after money; another one gets spoilt by it."]],[3155,["and one has, that’s why he is no good. If the rich had little less money it would be better for them."]],[3161,["And if the poor had little more it would be better."]],[3163,["So our Sahaja Yoga works for the people of the middle, middle things."]],[3169,["Now immediately you will say, “Then what about the poor of the world?”"]],[3173,["Immediately the attention will go there. “Mother, what do you think?”"]],[3176,["Now you don’t worry about that part."]],[3179,["There is God who has created them and He is going to look after them. Are you an economist?"]],[3186,["Then you are, you have done all bad things."]],[3190,["Because of faulty planning, because of selfish nature, because of conservatism,"]],[3195,["because of thinking that you are the person who should enjoy all your wealth,"]],[3199,["you have created these disparities. Human beings have created, not God,"]],[3203,["and when you have to achieve God you don’t have to think all these problems that human beings have created."]],[3208,["Like somebody came and told Me, “What about Vietnam?” I said,"]],[3211,["“Are you a governor appointed there?” You see, he had a problem of his own."]],[3218,["He was coming from an asylum and he asked Me, gets up very seriously, said,"]],[3222,["“What about Vietnam?” Now tell Me, this fellow is really half mad."]],[3225,["He’s gone to that asylum from where he has come, and why is he worried about this Vietnam?"]],[3230,["Now, what does that show? How is he going to help Vietnam?"]],[3235,["This is how the attention of human beings moves. I mean,"]],[3238,["what you have to do is to achieve that within yourself, your own powers."]],[3242,["Everyone has to achieve that power. Even if you are poor you can achieve it. What is poverty?"]],[3250,["It’s just mental idea, “It is poverty.” You see, for people I’ve seen,"]],[3254,["horrible people who are supposed to be rich just like beggars, I tell you, absolutely beggars."]],[3262,["Even if they could get out of you one torn handkerchief, oh, they will be very happy."]],[3270,["Horrible people, I don’t know, what riches, it has not gone even skin deep."]],[3275,["Even I would tell you that if you put so many pounds just posted on a donkey"]],[3283,["he would look better than these people are. I mean, it has not touched them at all, you see."]],[3288,["And the way they talk you know how the people are, how licentious they are,"]],[3293,["how permissive they are, how careless they are about their children,"]],[3296,["how they are irresponsible, how they are killing others just to save their reputation."]],[3303,["I mean, there’s nothing that they cannot do."]],[3306,["Same with poorer people; they are just the same. You see,"]],[3309,["if you go and talk to them, now our Maria had this, this thing, they said,"]],[3313,["“We, we want this man to be cured by Mataji but we are not going to believe in God.”"]],[3319,["Now what can you say to that? Only you can say to take two running jumps and go to hell."]],[3326,["That’s what it is meant for such horrible people."]],[3328,["They want to take advantage of God’s power and then, “We don’t believe in God.”"]],[3332,["See, this is poverty. And the poorer they are the worse they are in their arrogance,"]],[3340,["in their assertions, in their asking. They don’t want to do any work."]],[3344,["They want to have this. They want to have that."]],[3346,["All these things will be only explained once they achieve God. Otherwise they will not move."]],[3343,["They all must rise. I mean, that the way the churches have now become nothing but union offices,"]],[3363,["labor union offices. See, poor people go there and confess to the priest. Now, it’s madness."]],[3371,["He cannot do anything to them. What is he after all?"]],[3374,["He himself is an ordinary human being, ordained. Which by whom?"]],[3379,["God has ordained you? Or who has ordained you?"]],[3382,["All such organisations will only create headaches and people who have got nothing"]],[3390,["but some sort of an idea that they are something great. You see, you ask anyone,"]],[3395,["“What are you?” “I’m a Catholic.” What does that mean? “I’m a,” what you call that,"]],[3401,["“Church of England.” In India specially, the Indian Christians,"]],[3404,["if somebody is from Church of England he will not look at the person from Church of Scotland."]],[3412,["You should see Indians, you see when they are Christians you must see the way they are."]],[3417,["“Oh, we, we don’t talk to them.” I said, “Why?”"]],[3419,["“Because they are from the Church of Scotland, you know,”"]],[3422,["or Presbyterians you see, or Lutherans. So according to them"]],[3425,["they are the highest because Church of England."]],[3427,["Now they must come and see the condition of Church of England to understand. You see,"]],[3431,["this is the trouble. It is really, I tell you, like lunatic people. It’s absolutely like lunatic people."]],[3440,["They are brainwashed, completely. And by that they are not going to achieve anything."]],[3445,["We have to achieve the reality. We have to know that we have to achieve it"]],[3449,["and for that we have to stand by reality, face it moment and moment"]],[3453,["and then the enjoyment of reality will be uncovered and will be absolutely manifested within you."]],[3460,["But we have to stand by reality and not go by thinking, “I think, Mataji, You were wrong there.”"]],[3465,["I said, “Where? Where was I wrong?”"]],[3467,["“Because, You know, You told us this,” and that’s why I was wrong."]],[3471,["I said, “How do you know?” “I feel that way.”"]],[3473,["“Now, how can you feel about what I am thinking or what I am saying?"]],[3477,["You have to then understand rationally. But when I say rationally, do you understand?”"]],[3483,["“Rationally I understand but I don’t feel that way.”"]],[3485,["Now, what is this feel? See, a thing which is told to you rationally must be understood rationally."]],[3490,["And whatever is to be felt is to be felt through heart."]],[3494,["But they will feel a rational thing and they will think about the love. It is something absurd."]],[3502,["That’s why it is crazy. The attitude itself is crazy."]],[3506,["So open out yourself because there is an invitation."]],[3510,["There is a great invitation for you to enter into that kingdom of God which is promised to you."]],[3517,["You must know that God has created this earth. He has created you."]],[3523,["He is not going to allow His creation to be destroyed, will He? What are you worried about?"]],[3528,["He is the One who is going to take you across."]],[3532,["He is the One who is going to tell you each and everything that He has,"]],[3535,["to possess all the beauties, all the blessings that He has,"]],[3539,["to enjoy them. He is going to do everything for you."]],[3543,["But when the boat is crossing, keep quiet. Don’t run here and there."]],[3547,["All the time the children are running from here and there. You go on catching them."]],[3551,["“Come along. Come along.” Sometimes even they get drowned. Just keep quiet."]],[3555,["Everybody is going to get it, everybody is going to be taken into it and everybody is going to enjoy it."]],[3561,["For today I think it was quite a lecture though I have told you"]],[3566,["that Christ is on this chakra has come and that is the last chakra of Sahasrara"]],[3571,["which opened on the fifth of May in India in 1970"]],[3581,["and since then the new awareness has started becoming, dawning into people."]],[3589,["The vibrations have started flowing. And it’s a very great thing that you are born at this time"]],[3593,["and you are the people, the foundations."]],[3596,["You are the people who are going to receive it completely."]],[3599,["I don’t know about the future, what is going to happen to the future and all that"]],[3602,["but I am sure it is going to work out. And in this London,"]],[3607,["London which I have always said it’s the heart of the universe, we are going to do it"]],[3612,["with great understanding of the problems of the whole world."]],[3616,["If heart is all right everything will be all right because through it everything is going to circulate,"]],[3621,["and going to improve, and going to nurture, and going to develop this beautiful universe"]],[3627,["that God has created for you. But first thing you must know is to give up all your misidentifications."]],[3633,["And do not go on hankering onto them and again getting identifying yourself with them"]],[3640,["but keep a complete alert attention on your progress in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3647,["I’m sure it is going to work out. May God bless you all! Thank you."]],[3664,["So, any questions?"]],[3674,["Now, ask questions which are related to this lecture."]],[3680,["Because if you ask them out of the blue questions, you see"]],[3683,["not out of the blue questions, see what is there, now I need another lecture."]],[3687,["You see, I cannot just say what is God is and things like that."]],[3691,["So you please don’t ask such questions."]],[3693,["Ask something relating to this lecture that would help you and everybody."]],[3698,["And ask questions which are constructive."]],[3721,["Question: [Inaudible] 5th of May."]],[3726,["Shri Mataji: That happened… That is the day when the en-masse Realisation was established…"]],[3736,["Why? Question: Where?"]],[3739,["Shri Mataji: Where? In India."]],[3742,["Question: [Inaudible]"]],[3748,["Shri Mataji: It happened in My brain. And it happened on a sea shore in India when I saw it…."]],[3760,["And of course I will tell you some time how beautifully it worked out, and how beautiful it was."]],[3770,["Question: [Inaudible]"]],[3789,["Shri Mataji: One of the names it is in the one book I have given you, is that Nirvicharita,"]],[3791,["Now you think of that thought. You see,"]],[3810,["now you cannot. Can you?  Try."]],[3824,["No, no. That is the fact. One must accept. You have crossed the Agnya."]],[3831,["You see, now you cannot. Enjoy it. Enjoy it. It’s very good."]],[3837,["Now you can see the thoughts also. Are you returned now? Are you feeling better Hester?"]],[3843,["Good. This is very beautiful."]],[3859,["Enjoy it. Forget it."]],[3861,["Forget about that. We are going to meet again and again and you’ll have ample time."]],[3868,["But the more you will be meeting the more you’ll become thoughtless,"]],[3872,["the more you’ll be enjoying the silence within you,"]],[3874,["more you will be going deep into your own silence, really enjoying it."]],[3878,["Actually after Realisation you don’t even feel bored. You’ll be surprised."]],[3882,["You’ll be sitting for hours together without getting bored, absolutely without getting bored."]],[3886,["And that’s how people give up, you see, all these habits of say, smoking and all those"]],[3891,["because when you are bored you don’t know what to do so you take to these habits."]],[3895,["That’s what you get it. You are not to be forced, you are not to be told"]],[3898,["but once you start enjoying yourself you just don’t do it. [Hindi]"]],[3911,["Are you better now? Not yet? [Hindi] He’s a born-realised, still."]]]);
